usage: selection.py [-h] {dry-run,mock,execute,run-stage} ...

Independent PM-RL1 selection runner. Default: offline; no sealed reader. No
imports of model runtimes or network clients until explicit live execution.
The existing scorer, rubric, contract, outputs and human intake are read-only.

positional arguments:
  {dry-run,mock,execute,run-stage}
    dry-run             verify dev-only plan and list phases; no model or
                        network
    mock                run offline transport, original parser and mock budget
                        ledger
    execute             legacy individual real entry disabled; use paired run-
                        stage
    run-stage           counterbalanced four-configuration stage; defaults to
                        mock

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
